window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>We are the Royals of Corline.</p> <p>Our futures are arranged, our lives planned to the letter. <br> But each of us is about to break tradition, throw the rules aside, and follow our hearts.</p> <p>Being royalty might mean a life in service to our country, but it doesn’t mean a life without love.</p> <p>At least, not anymore.</p> <p>This collection includes the stories of all three Royals of Corline.</p> <ul> <li>The Virgin’s Playboy Prince</li> <li>The Virgin’s Royal Guard</li> <li>The Virgin’s Forbidden Lord</li> <li>The Virgin's Royal Secret</li> </ul>"; 
